cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Ku-Mellin-PATP: reproducibility code"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SZabolotnii/Ku-Mellin-PATP-code-supplement"
url: "https://github.com/SZabolotnii/Ku-Mellin-PATP-code-supplement"
abstract: >-
  Verification and reproducibility code for the paper "Closed-form moment
  propagation through fractional-power response surfaces via the Mellin
  transform". Reproduces the CAS cross-checks of the closed-form
  moment-propagation formula, the region-of-validity table, the heavy-tail
  admissibility condition on unbounded support, the closed-form
  Mellin-transform table, the manufactured-solution benchmark (Table 3 /
  Figure 1), the separable 2-D propagation (Table 4) and the real-data
  vibration-power case study (Table 5). Includes the Lean 4 / Mathlib
  formalization of the four supporting lemmas.
type: software
